## Impact
The current implementation of `previewWithdraw()` doesn't follow the [`EIP4626 Specification`](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4626). More specifically:
> MUST NOT be inclusive of any fees that are charged against assets in the Vault.

## Proof of Concept
Looking at `previewWithdraw()`:
```solidity
function previewWithdraw(uint256 assets)
    public
    view
    override
    returns (uint256)
{
    IBeefyStrat strat = IBeefyStrat(beefyVault.strategy());
    uint256 beefyFee = strat.withdrawalFee();
    if (beefyFee > 0)    				   //@audit also rounds up when it should be rounding down to zero for fees
        assets = assets.mulDiv(
            BPS_DENOMINATOR,
            BPS_DENOMINATOR - beefyFee,
